# Generated self-check output at the repo root ONLY.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing and was added after this rule silently
# excluded `apps/backoffice-api/src/reports/` — an entire source module —
# from a commit that shipped the import of it. A bare `reports/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, so `git add` reported nothing amiss,
# the local build passed against files still on disk, and `main` was broken
# on a fresh clone. Verified by cloning it.
/reports/
